#. やっぱり…<CLT 3>片面だけがキレイな状態<CLT>っていうのは、
#. おかしいよ…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Actually, <CLT 3>one side being clean<CLT> is pretty strange, if\n"
"you think about it..."
msgstr ""

#. だってさ…爆破される前の死体って、
#. まだ<CLT 3>血が乾いてない状態<CLT>だったんだよ？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Because...<CLT 3>the blood wasn't dry<CLT> before the body got\n"
"blown up, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 触ると汚れる危険性がある…
#. 十神クンだって、そう言ってたよね？
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Byakuya said it himself—not to touch it or you might\n"
"get some on you."
msgstr ""

#. そんな死体にビニールシートを被せたら、
#. 間違いなく、血で汚れちゃうはずだよ。
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"If you put a tarp on a body in that state, it\n"
"absolutely would have gotten blood on it."
msgstr ""

#. 犯人が洗ったんじゃね？
#. ビニールシートが使われた事を隠す為によ…
msgctxt "0005 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Well...maybe the culprit washed it, so nobody would\n"
"know they'd used it."
msgstr ""

#. それなら両面を洗い流すはずだ。
#. 片面だけ洗ったところで隠した事にはならない…
msgctxt "0006 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If they had, they would've washed both sides. \n"
"Just washing the one side wouldn't hide anything."
msgstr ""

#. そりゃ、まぁ…そうだな…
msgctxt "0007 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Oh...yeah, true."
msgstr ""

#. そもそも、その時の死体の血自体が、
#. 犯人の<CLT 3>偽装工作<CLT>だとしたら？
msgctxt "0008 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"More than that, what if the very blood we saw on the\n"
"body was meant as a kind of <CLT 3>camouflage<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>え…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Huh...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの血が…偽装工作？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The blood was...camouflage?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. つまり、犯人はビニールシートで、
#. スプリンクラーをやり過ごした後で…
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"What if, after the killer used the tarp to avoid the\n"
"sprinklers..."
msgstr ""

#. 死体の上から、
#. <CLT 3>偽物の血<CLT>をまいたんじゃないかしら？
msgctxt "0012 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"...they then covered the body in <CLT 3>blood that didn't\n"
"belong to the victim<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. に、偽物の血って…
#. そんな物が…どこにあるのよ…！？
msgctxt "0013 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Y-You mean...someone else's b-blood? Where would they\n"
"get something l-like that?"
msgstr ""

#. わかった！　<CLT 3>保健室<CLT>の輸血用の血じゃねーか？
msgctxt "0014 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I know! They coulda grabbed some of the blood packs\n"
"from the <CLT 3>nurse's office<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. 前に、山田っちが死んだフリをした時、
#. あいつは、あの血を使ってたはずだべ？
msgctxt "0015 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"That's what Hifumi did, right? When he pretended to be\n"
"dead?"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ…今回の殺人で使われたのは、
#. あの血じゃないわ…
msgctxt "0016 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "No, that's not what happened this time."
msgstr ""

#. 犯人は、現場の<CLT 3>植物庭園<CLT>から、
#. 偽物の血を調達しているはずよ。
msgctxt "0017 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The killer got the blood from right there in the\n"
"<CLT 3>garden<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. それと血液の調達を結びつける気か？
msgctxt "0018 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"How is that supposed to be connected to the\n"
"acquisition of blood?"
msgstr ""

#. まったく…また無駄な議論をするつもりか…
msgctxt "0019 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Another useless argument..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 植物庭園に血なんてないべ？
#. やっぱり、保健室の輸血用のじゃねーか？
msgctxt "0021 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"There's no blood in the garden, right? It had to have\n"
"come from the nurse's office!"
msgstr ""

#. あ、もしかして！
#. 犯人が自分の血をまいたとか？
msgctxt "0022 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Ooh, or maybe the killer used their own blood!"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あんな量をまいたら…
#. 無事じゃすまないわよ…！
msgctxt "0023 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"If you lost th-that much blood...things probably\n"
"wouldn't end w-well for you...!"
msgstr ""

#. 話が進まないわね…
#. 苗木君、貴方は何か意見がないの？
msgctxt "0024 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"We're not making any progress. Don't you have anything\n"
"to say, Makoto?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>現場から偽物の血を調達している…？
#. だとしたら、偽物の血って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They got blood from right there in the garden, right?\n"
"Which must mean...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. もしかして…<CLT 3>ニワトリの血<CLT>…？
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Could it have been...<CLT 3>chicken blood<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. …え！？　ニワトリ！？
msgctxt "0028 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "What!? Chicken blood!?"
msgstr ""

#. 事件前に植物庭園の飼育小屋を見た時は、
#. そこに、ニワトリが<CLT 3>５羽<CLT>いたのに…
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"When I checked the chicken coop before the murder,\n"
"there were <CLT 3>five chickens<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 事件後には<CLT 3>４羽<CLT>に減ってたんだ…
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But after the murder, there were only <CLT 3>four<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. つ、つまり…犯人はニワトリを殺して、
#. その血を使ったってんか…？
msgctxt "0031 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"S-So you're saying...someone killed a chicken and then\n"
"covered the body with its blood!?"
msgstr ""

#. なんつー残酷な事すんだべ！！
msgctxt "0032 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Man, that's messed up!"
msgstr ""

#. そんな事で生き物を殺すなんて酷いよ！
#. どうせだったら、私が食べたのに！
msgctxt "0033 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Killing a living thing just to do something like that\n"
"is awful! They should have at least eaten it!"
msgstr ""

#. 犯人が、わざわざ現場から血を調達したのは、
#. 自分が歩き回る姿を目撃されたくなかったからかしら…
msgctxt "0034 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I wonder if the killer had to get the blood from the\n"
"scene so they wouldn't be spotted walking around..."
msgstr ""

#. …とにかく、実際にニワトリが減っている事が、
#. 今の推理の根拠になるはずよ。
msgctxt "0035 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Anyway, there's no denying that a chicken went\n"
"missing, which provides a basis for my theory."
msgstr ""

#. だとしても、少々引っ掛かるな…
msgctxt "0036 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Perhaps, but even so...there's one thing that still\n"
"doesn't make sense."
msgstr ""

#. 犯人はビニールシートでスプリンクラーをやり過ごし、
#. その後で、偽物の血をまいたと言ったな…？
msgctxt "0037 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"You said the culprit used the tarp to avoid the water,\n"
"and then covered the body in blood, right?"
msgstr ""

#. だが、死体の上から血をまいたなら、
#. 周辺の床にも血が流れてしまうはずだ…
msgctxt "0038 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"But if that's the case, then the blood should have\n"
"soaked into the ground around the body."
msgstr ""

#. あの時の死体は違ったぞ…
#. 血で汚れていたのは<CLT 3>死体の服<CLT>だけだった。
msgctxt "0039 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"But that's not what we saw. Only the <CLT 3>victim's\n"
"clothing<CLT> had blood on it."
msgstr ""

#. 周辺の床は、まったく汚れてなかった…
msgctxt "0040 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "The ground was completely clean."
msgstr ""

#. 確かに…周辺の床がまったく汚れていないのは変ね…
msgctxt "0041 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I have to agree, that certainly is strange..."
msgstr ""

#. だとしたら、犯人はその場で血をまいたんじゃなくて、
#. 前もって白衣に血を付着させておいたのかもね…
msgctxt "0042 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Maybe they didn't apply the blood at the scene. Maybe\n"
"they covered the coat in blood beforehand."
msgstr ""

#. 前もって…白衣に血を…？
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "They covered it...beforehand?"
msgstr ""

#. あなた達が発見した時の死体って、
#. その白衣をちゃんと着ていたの？
msgctxt "0044 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"When you discovered the body, was it wearing the coat\n"
"like you normally would?"
msgstr ""

#. えっと…確か…
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Um...I think so..."
msgstr ""

#. いや…袖を通していなかった…
#. 上から白衣をかけられただけの状態だったよ…
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Wait, no... The head was through the neck hole, but\n"
"the arms weren't in the sleeves."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…これで決まりね…
msgctxt "0047 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Then that settles it."
msgstr ""

#. …ごめん、話に付いていけてないんだけど、
#. どう決まったの？
msgctxt "0048 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"...Sorry, I'm having a tough time keeping up. What\n"
"settles what...?"
msgstr ""

#. つまり、殺人が起きたのは、
#. <CLT 3>スプリンクラーが作動するより前<CLT>だったのよ。
msgctxt "0049 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Here's what happened—the murder took place <CLT 3>before the\n"
"sprinklers went off<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. それなのに、死体が濡れなかったのは、
#. 犯人が死体にビニールシートを被せたから…
msgctxt "0050 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But the body didn't get wet, because the killer\n"
"covered it with the tarp."
msgstr ""

#. そして、その後、
#. 犯人はビニールシートを回収するのと同時に…
msgctxt "0051 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Then, later, at the same time the killer was gathering\n"
"up the tarp..."
msgstr ""

#. あらかじめ偽物の血で汚しておいた白衣を、
#. 死体の上にかけた…
msgctxt "0052 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"...they pulled the coat over the body. The coat they'd\n"
"already covered in blood."
msgstr ""

#. 犯人は、これら一連の偽装工作を行う事で、
#. 殺人が起きた時間帯を誤認させようとしたのよ。
msgctxt "0053 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"This series of cover-ups was meant to disguise the\n"
"actual time the murder occurred."
msgstr ""

#. 殺人は、スプリンクラーが動く７時３０分よりも後に
#. 起きたんだってね…
msgctxt "0054 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"They wanted us to think the murder happened sometime\n"
"after the sprinklers had gone off, at 7:30."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 確かに、その方法なら、
#. ７時３０分よりも前に殺人を実行する事が可能だな…
msgctxt "0056 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If that's actually what took place, it certainly\n"
"becomes possible that the murder happened earlier..."
msgstr ""

#. だけどさ…その偽装工作をする為には…
msgctxt "0057 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "But...to pull all that off..."
msgstr ""

#. スプリンクラーが終わった後に、
#. 植物庭園に行かなくちゃいけないよね？
msgctxt "0058 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"...wouldn't they have had to go back to the garden\n"
"after the sprinklers turned off?"
msgstr ""

#. 大した時間はかからない…
msgctxt "0059 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That actually wouldn't have been all that difficult."
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0060 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. ビニールシートを回収した後、
#. 用意しておいた白衣をかけるだけ…
msgctxt "0061 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"They already had the coat ready. So they just had to\n"
"grab the tarp and pull the coat over the body."
msgstr ""

#. 大した時間はかからないわ。
msgctxt "0062 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "They'd be done in no time."
msgstr ""

#. それは…そうかもしれないけど…
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Maybe, but still..."
msgstr ""

#. 朝日奈さんは、食堂で苗木君と会った後、
#. 彼と一緒に行動したの？
msgctxt "0064 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Hina. After you met up with Makoto in the dining hall,\n"
"did you two stay together from that point on?"
msgstr ""

#. ううん…私は先に体育館に行ってて…
#. 苗木は後から遅れて来たんだよ…
msgctxt "0065 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Oh, no. I headed off to the gym, and Makoto didn't\n"
"show up till later."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、その位の時間的余裕はあったわね？
msgctxt "0066 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Then he had plenty of time to spare, wouldn't you say?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そんな…ッ！！
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Th-That's not—!"
msgstr ""

#. 不可能とは言い切れないはずよ。
msgctxt "0068 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Don't bother saying it's not possible."
msgstr ""

#. うっ…！！
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Ng...!"
msgstr ""

#. どうやら、霧切の言う通りのようだ。
#. 苗木のアリバイは不十分だ…
msgctxt "0070 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I must admit, Kyoko's reasoning is sound. Makoto's\n"
"alibi is...inadequate."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>結局…容疑者に逆戻りって事か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And the suspicion falls back on me again...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、どうして…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But why...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どうして、霧切さんは…
#. ボクを追い詰めるようとするんだよ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Why is Kyoko trying to entrap me?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どうして…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't understand...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0076 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>死体の偽装工作<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0077 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Disguised Dead Body<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …さてと、振り出しに戻ったな。
msgctxt "0078 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Well then, it looks like we're back to square one."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木のアリバイが不十分となると、
#. 容疑者は、苗木と霧切の２人という事になる…
msgctxt "0079 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Makoto's alibi is no good, so once again our suspects\n"
"are him and Kyoko."
msgstr ""

#. リアルな話…どっちが犯人だべ…？
msgctxt "0080 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "For serious, man...which one of 'em did it?"
msgstr ""

#. よっしゃ、思い切って運に任せっか？
#. ２分の１の確率だし！
msgctxt "0081 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Hey, why don't we let luck decide? Let's flip a coin!\n"
"Fifty-fifty odds!"
msgstr ""

#. あッ…！
msgctxt "0082 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Oh—!"
msgstr ""

#. …だろ？　ナイスアイデアだべ？
msgctxt "0083 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "See? Pretty good idea, right?"
msgstr ""

#. そうじゃなくって！
#. すごい事、思い出しちゃったんだけど！
msgctxt "0084 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"No, not that! I just remembered something super\n"
"serious!"
msgstr ""

#. …なんだ、言ってみろ。
msgctxt "0085 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Well, don't just stand there. Out with it."
msgstr ""

#. あのさ、現場に黒コゲになった<CLT 3>ナイフ<CLT>が
#. 落ちてたでしょ？
msgctxt "0086 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "You know that <CLT 3>knife<CLT> we found all black and burnt?"
msgstr ""

#. あぁ、爆発前の死体に刺さってたヤツだべ？
msgctxt "0087 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"The one we found stuck in the body before it exploded,\n"
"right?"
msgstr ""

#. モノクマファイルによると、
#. <CLT 3>腹部から背中<CLT>まで、ぶっ刺さってたらしいぞ…
msgctxt "0088 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"According to the Monokuma File, the knife went all the\n"
"way through, <CLT 3>from front to back<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. で、そのナイフがどうした？
msgctxt "0089 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "So? What about it?"
msgstr ""

#. あのナイフ…どこかで見た気がしてたんだけど…
msgctxt "0090 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I'm pretty sure I'd seen that knife somewhere\n"
"before..."
msgstr ""

#. それを…思い出しちゃったんだよね。
msgctxt "0091 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"That's what I thought when I first saw it. I just\n"
"remembered!"
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、そんな事よりさ…
msgctxt "0092 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Listen, more important..."
msgstr ""

#. そのナイフ、どうするの？
msgctxt "0093 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Now that we have the knife, what are we gonna\n"
"do with it?"
msgstr ""

#. 腐川っちに預けておけねー事は確かだべ。
#. 何するかわかんねーしな…
msgctxt "0094 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"We can't let Toko keep it, that's for sure. We dunno\n"
"what she might do..."
msgstr ""

#. こ、こんな物騒な物…こっちからお断りよ…ッ！
msgctxt "0095 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "I don't w-want it anyway!"
msgstr ""

#. うーん…困ったね…
msgctxt "0096 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hmm...so what to do...?"
msgstr ""

#. …苗木君が預かったらいいじゃない。
msgctxt "0097 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Why don't you hang on to it, Makoto?"
msgstr ""

#. え？　ボクが！？
msgctxt "0098 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? Me!?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あたしが…<CLT 3>苗木に預けたナイフ<CLT>…！？
msgctxt "0099 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "I-It's...the knife we <CLT 3>g-gave to Makoto<CLT>!?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0100 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 驚かないという事は、
#. とっくに気付いていたようだな…
msgctxt "0101 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"You don't seem surprised. You must have noticed\n"
"earlier..."
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…
msgctxt "0102 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-Yeah..."
msgstr ""

#. だったら、なぜ隠していた？
msgctxt "0103 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Then why did you hide that fact?"
msgstr ""

#. 隠してた訳じゃないんだ。ただ…
msgctxt "0104 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's not that I hid it. It's just..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボク自身が確信を持てなかっただけなんだ。
#. 昨日の夜、あそこで起きた事について…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0105 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I couldn't be sure of what actually happened last\n"
"night.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もしかしたら…自分が殺したんじゃないかって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0106 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I thought maybe...I really did kill her...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 怪しい…怪し過ぎるべ…
msgctxt "0107 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Suspicious... Very suspicious indeed!"
msgstr ""

#. 死体に刺さってたナイフが
#. 苗木っちのモンだったって事は…
msgctxt "0108 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "The knife we found stuck in the body came from Makoto!"
msgstr ""

#. こりゃ、もう間違いねーべ！
#. １２００％の確率で苗木っちが犯人だべ！
msgctxt "0109 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Now I'm totally convinced he did it! Twelve thousand\n"
"percent convinced!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、ここに至るまでの議論で、
#. ハッキリしたはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0110 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Considering everything up till now, I should be able\n"
"to make it clear...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>やっぱり、ボクは殺してなんかいない…！
#. ボクは犯人なんかじゃないんだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0111 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have to prove that I didn't murder anyone! I'm NOT\n"
"the killer!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
